    "updated_at": "2022-12-23T01:27:01Z",
    "body": "I would expect the web app manifest spec to describe this. Including important invariants like how it relates to the various algorithms in that spec, any properties relating to origins, openers, or browsing context groups, navigation scope, etc.\r\n\r\nThis might be related to HTML if there's some need to propagate the app ID between environment settings objects, e.g. during navigation. But I think the web app manifest people have the most context on what would consitute a given environment settings object / Window / realm as being related to an installed web application.",
